    prof16sc         & 6{,}000 & random key, M=32 & profiling \\
    gain35\_10k      & 10{,}000 & random key & profiling \\
    unmasked merged  & 6{,}243 & random key & S-box profiling \\
    masked (main2)   & 9{,}151 & random key & masking control \\
